Web Development 
    .the creation of an app that works over the internet 
    .its building, creating, and maintaining websites 
    .includes aspects like web design, web publishing, web programming, & DB management 
>> user access website through web browser 
    .browser sends HTTP request to the web server to fetch the required webpage 
    .web server processes the request; may interact with DB to retrieve or store data 
    .server sends response to browser containing the webpage resources after processing 
    .browser renders and displays the webpage to the user using security mechanisms like HTTPS to protect data and prevent attacks


